  "findings": [
    "Both official source archives have Abseil, FP16, rapidhash and a separate V8 zlib build path without named aggregate licence sections; the original separate licence files are preserved.",
    "Node 24 additionally selects Highway in its V8 GYP dependencies; its full upstream Apache notice is preserved.",
    "Source references and notice headers do not supply actual linked binary library versions. No version is inferred from a notice or a source directory.",
    "Both original Windows Node binaries import eleven library names. This static file inspection does not identify host-library versions or qualify native execution.",
    "Both source archives ship seven ncrypto files and no separate ncrypto licence. Upstream provenance remains open; absence alone establishes no licence.",
    "Node 24 V8 conversions includes fast_float headers, but the source archive contains no corresponding full licence file. Upstream provenance remains open.",
    "GN-only and conditional V8 components require actual Node GYP/build-selection review before any complete inventory claim."
